# Downloaded sd-server release binary and model weights/LoRAs: staging
# prerequisites recorded by tag/size/sha256 in the README, never committed.
# No trailing slash: these are symlinks into the main checkout when the
# worktree shares assets (standing asset-preservation rule).
bin
models

# Raw per-run output, generated images and logs (README is the durable record).
results/*
!results/.gitkeep
scratch
